---
source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "subcommand_help(\"forget\")"
---
Remove one episodic event and the lesson state that names it (BZR-151).

Stop a live `dreamd watch` first; the command refuses while the daemon is running.

Usage: forget [OPTIONS] <EVENT_ID>

Arguments:
  <EVENT_ID>
          The event id to remove (`evt_` + 26 Crockford base32 characters)

Options:
      --dry-run
          Print what would be removed without writing anything

      --proof <PATH>
          Write a forget-receipt/1.0 JSON file (event id, lesson effect, ledger root, orphan edges) to PATH after a removal. Not a signed proof

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
